  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir-fry for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the ajiaco and stir-fry for 3-4 minutes until it starts to brown.",
    "Add the silky sauce, soy sauce, and stir-fry for another 2-3 minutes until the sauce has thickened.",
